426	    <div class="f-body"><p>Confirmed by <code>canon:drift-checker</code> against every provider criterion: <strong>9 of 20</strong> pricing acceptance criteria are drifted, all from this one root cause. <code>claude.rs</code> passes the raw <code>message.model</code> field straight through; <code>agy.rs</code>, <code>codex.rs</code>, and <code>opencode.rs</code> never reassign <code>model_family</code> from its hardcoded default at all.</p>
